WEBVTT

00:01.340 --> 00:08.320
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.110 --> 00:14.160
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.820 --> 00:19.090
<i>His own mother distanced herself from him,
 his friends called him a monster...</i>

00:19.090 --> 00:20.430
<i>Even people he'd never met spoke of him as</i>

00:20.430 --> 00:23.510
<i>"death incarnate that dwells in the forest."</i>

00:24.170 --> 00:29.220
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

00:30.650 --> 00:34.470
B... E... A...

00:35.460 --> 00:37.460
It's kinda cold in here.

00:37.460 --> 00:41.030
I wish your room was warmer, Alice.

00:41.030 --> 00:42.810
I'm sorry.

00:42.810 --> 00:48.830
F... C... D... D... D!

00:48.830 --> 00:50.690
Cut that out!

00:50.690 --> 00:52.030
What are you doing?

00:52.460 --> 00:55.180
I was trying to read a book.

00:55.600 --> 00:58.280
But I'm getting stuck 
with the letters past F.

00:59.320 --> 01:01.480
You can read up to F, huh?

01:01.480 --> 01:03.040
Rob taught me!

01:03.040 --> 01:06.000
What? How naughty! I'm jealous!

01:06.230 --> 01:09.010
Wait, Rob was nice enough to teach you,

01:09.010 --> 01:11.250
and you can't read past F?

01:11.510 --> 01:12.350
Yes.

01:12.350 --> 01:14.040
I forgot most of it.

01:14.430 --> 01:15.940
Dummy!

01:16.330 --> 01:18.730
You forget because you don't practice!

01:18.730 --> 01:20.470
I'll give you some practice problems.

01:21.400 --> 01:23.890
Okay, what letters go here?

01:24.490 --> 01:26.510
You're a good artist, Viola.

01:27.160 --> 01:29.300
That's very good.

01:29.300 --> 01:31.360
That doesn't matter right now!

01:33.820 --> 01:34.920
No!

01:34.920 --> 01:37.960
Don't just make things up because 
you don't know the answer!

01:37.960 --> 01:40.400
Don't worry. I'll get it right next time.

01:40.400 --> 01:43.040
Where is that confidence coming from?

01:43.860 --> 01:46.000
Okay, you know up to F.

01:46.570 --> 01:47.810
Remember what comes next!

01:48.680 --> 01:50.530
After F?

01:51.050 --> 01:52.640
<i>That's tough...</i>

01:52.640 --> 01:55.640
<i>I'm sure Zain could get it easily.</i>

01:57.220 --> 01:59.440
I know the answer! It's G!

01:59.440 --> 02:00.660
That's right.

02:00.660 --> 02:01.680
How did you know?

02:01.970 --> 02:06.390
Zain once told me I'm a G cup,
 which is bigger than F!

02:06.390 --> 02:07.640
That's how I remembered!

02:08.650 --> 02:10.930
A G cup...

02:12.490 --> 02:16.240
A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

02:16.240 --> 02:19.990
A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

02:19.110 --> 02:19.990
Cut it out!

03:50.000 --> 03:54.060
Episode 21
The Duke, Alice, and the Second Anniversary

04:11.920 --> 04:14.140
Hey. You really came!

04:16.200 --> 04:17.860
I happened to be passing by...

04:18.570 --> 04:21.340
Is this any trouble?

04:21.340 --> 04:22.570
Not at all.

04:22.890 --> 04:24.480
I'm happy to have you here.

04:26.860 --> 04:30.080
Let's go inside and get out of the rain.

04:31.000 --> 04:31.910
But...

04:32.170 --> 04:35.360
I can't send a lady away like this.

04:35.360 --> 04:36.040
Come on.

04:41.510 --> 04:43.830
I haven't been inside here in a long time.

04:44.160 --> 04:45.940
It hasn't changed much.

04:45.940 --> 04:49.560
That's right. You said you 
used to come here a lot.

04:49.970 --> 04:51.050
Yes.

04:51.050 --> 04:56.060
There were a lot of visitors 
here then. We didn't really stand out.

04:56.400 --> 04:58.550
But now it's very quiet.

04:58.940 --> 05:01.200
My dad's been in the hospital a long time.

05:01.200 --> 05:03.070
And my mom is a very quiet person.

05:03.730 --> 05:07.560
We only socialize to the bare 
minimum extent expected of nobles.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.800
I see.

05:09.770 --> 05:13.910
Gerbera went back to who she was before, then.

05:15.040 --> 05:16.260
You know my mother?

05:16.810 --> 05:19.610
I saw her a lot.

05:20.020 --> 05:23.260
I don't think she knows me.

05:24.000 --> 05:26.470
She would've been 18...

05:27.610 --> 05:31.430
She'd just graduated school when 
she married into this household.

05:32.260 --> 05:37.070
Her parents were very strict, and she
 was a very stern woman herself.

05:38.090 --> 05:40.650
But that changed when Sharon came...

05:41.090 --> 05:44.530
She smiled a lot. She talked a lot.

05:44.530 --> 05:46.360
She looked like she was having so much fun.

05:47.070 --> 05:49.320
It's hard to imagine my mother like that...

05:50.140 --> 05:53.290
She was a bit harsh to her children.

05:53.750 --> 05:57.790
She wanted them to grow up 
to be proper nobles, I think.

05:58.370 --> 06:03.000
But what happened to Sharon must've 
come as a huge shock to her.

06:04.960 --> 06:07.100
I'm sorry, I shouldn't have said that.

06:07.100 --> 06:07.970
It's fine.

06:08.810 --> 06:10.220
Thanks for telling me.

06:14.170 --> 06:15.680
The tea's gone cold.

06:16.530 --> 06:19.810
Wait. I'll go have them make some more.

06:19.810 --> 06:21.640
It's okay. I'll be leaving soon.

06:22.690 --> 06:23.610
It's fine.

06:31.000 --> 06:33.490
I'm back. The maids will...

06:34.570 --> 06:35.380
Huh?

06:37.970 --> 06:39.710
"See you later."

06:44.340 --> 06:46.130
Her handwriting is so pretty.

06:53.710 --> 06:56.610
So you know, then...

06:57.070 --> 07:01.150
About the two women in white habits 
who would come to the mansion.

07:03.220 --> 07:05.150
Someone told me.

07:05.150 --> 07:09.040
The "one-eyed man" is you, right?

07:09.040 --> 07:10.430
<i>"The one-eyed man?"</i>

07:10.430 --> 07:12.740
<i>I've got a cool nickname?</i>

07:12.740 --> 07:14.080
Oh my.

07:14.690 --> 07:17.420
I kept it a secret. I'm sorry.

07:17.420 --> 07:19.720
For my sake, yes?

07:21.610 --> 07:26.750
If I'd known the two of them killed my mother,
 it would've been a great shock to me.

07:27.120 --> 07:29.830
So you said she died in an accident,

07:29.830 --> 07:32.710
and you knew nothing about 
two women in nun's habits.

07:33.740 --> 07:35.660
You're right.

07:36.930 --> 07:40.970
Tell me everything you know about them.

07:40.970 --> 07:44.010
It might have something to 
do with His Grace's curse.

07:47.300 --> 07:55.070
It happened back when this mansion 
was still where we all lived.

07:55.780 --> 07:58.730
The master was a man of deep faith,

07:58.730 --> 08:01.560
so I never really questioned it.

08:02.460 --> 08:03.630
The master?

08:03.630 --> 08:05.630
His Grace's grandfather.

08:06.040 --> 08:09.880
The one who hired me as a servant.

08:10.500 --> 08:14.810
He was quite close to 
Sharon. You don't remember?

08:14.810 --> 08:20.100
I'm sorry. I remember little 
of my youth except His Grace.

08:20.940 --> 08:24.590
What was the relationship 
between the two of them?

08:24.590 --> 08:26.810
Nothing scandalous.

08:26.810 --> 08:30.280
They were close, that's all.

08:30.680 --> 08:33.830
They were master and servant, and friends...

08:33.830 --> 08:37.780
Like parent and child, 
or teacher and student...

08:38.760 --> 08:42.040
I loved to see them.

08:42.040 --> 08:47.330
So when I saw how much you and 
His Grace care for each other...

08:48.830 --> 08:51.460
It felt like fate.

08:57.070 --> 08:59.470
What was I talking about, again?

08:59.870 --> 09:02.060
The two nuns.

09:02.060 --> 09:04.290
Ah, yes.

09:04.290 --> 09:09.480
I stopped seeing them after the master died.

09:09.480 --> 09:13.030
When I last saw them, they were 
taking Sharon away with them.

09:13.030 --> 09:17.360
The Duke had just been cursed, 
and everything was falling apart.

09:17.630 --> 09:21.460
I didn't have time to think about them.

09:21.460 --> 09:24.720
That's all I know.

09:24.720 --> 09:26.380
Thank you.

09:27.370 --> 09:29.330
I'll tell His Grace, too.

09:30.380 --> 09:34.590
Hearing the piano has 
made me want to see him.

09:35.670 --> 09:37.750
Even though you're together all the time?

09:37.750 --> 09:38.550
Yes.

09:39.350 --> 09:41.510
You should come inside too, Rob.

09:41.510 --> 09:43.270
You'll catch cold.

09:43.970 --> 09:45.770
No, I'm fine.

09:47.190 --> 09:49.370
I want to watch the rain.

10:06.370 --> 10:08.250
If you've nowhere to go,

10:08.250 --> 10:10.580
come to the mansion in the northern forest.

10:37.300 --> 10:39.450
It sure is pouring today.

10:39.450 --> 10:41.320
Is the circus closed today?

10:41.320 --> 10:41.910
Oh, yeah.

10:42.170 --> 10:43.660
Our next performance is...

10:44.320 --> 10:46.350
You're Daleth, right?

10:46.350 --> 10:47.370
Yes. Why?

10:47.370 --> 10:50.470
You made such a big deal about not 
letting anybody see your face.

10:51.010 --> 10:52.330
Is that over with?

10:52.630 --> 10:56.090
Yes. I'm going to be like this from now on.

10:56.090 --> 10:57.520
How many times do I have to repeat myself?

10:57.520 --> 10:59.550
It's my first time hearing it, though.

10:59.550 --> 11:01.700
You're as pretty as they said, though!

11:01.700 --> 11:03.720
You might actually be my type!

11:06.690 --> 11:09.610
Crap! Cuff's not here today!

11:10.040 --> 11:12.520
It doesn't feel right 
without her yelling at me.

11:12.880 --> 11:15.400
So? What do you want?

11:15.400 --> 11:18.230
You didn't just come to say hi, right?

11:18.230 --> 11:20.080
I came to a realization.

11:20.080 --> 11:22.760
From now on, let's be friends, not enemies.

11:24.270 --> 11:31.150
I realized that helping you might 
mean helping myself as well.

11:31.150 --> 11:33.330
Yeah, I don't think I believe that.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.330
Well, you should.

11:35.330 --> 11:37.550
I've already worked things out with the boy.

11:38.130 --> 11:40.070
Talk to him if you don't believe me.

11:40.430 --> 11:41.780
Fine.

11:41.780 --> 11:44.490
You're mean, and you hide too many things.

11:44.490 --> 11:46.020
But you don't lie.

11:46.450 --> 11:48.670
So, what do you want me to do?

11:48.670 --> 11:50.260
For today, I'll just give you a hint.

11:50.260 --> 11:54.010
First, learn about my older sister, Sade.

11:54.010 --> 11:55.020
Huh?

11:55.020 --> 11:58.200
If she's your sister, why don't you tell me?

11:58.200 --> 11:59.990
That won't help at all...

12:01.280 --> 12:02.700
Did you forget?

12:10.410 --> 12:11.880
You knew?

12:11.880 --> 12:13.250
Of course I did.

12:13.900 --> 12:15.880
Say hello to Cuff for me.

12:16.550 --> 12:18.980
Tell her I'll forgive her for hitting me.

12:18.980 --> 12:19.840
O-Okay.

12:20.960 --> 12:22.880
Sade, huh?

12:22.880 --> 12:25.550
I'll have to talk to Cuff when she gets back.

12:26.880 --> 12:28.560
You don't think it's creepy?

12:29.080 --> 12:31.520
Making a cake...

12:31.520 --> 12:34.030
Seems fine to me! She'll like it!

12:34.030 --> 12:34.980
Y-You think?

12:35.670 --> 12:38.350
Thanks for coming, by the way!

12:38.350 --> 12:41.690
Nah, you said it's Alice's 2nd birthday!

12:41.990 --> 12:43.950
Of course I'm coming!

12:43.950 --> 12:46.650
Oh, sorry. That's not quite right.

12:46.650 --> 12:48.330
It's not her second birthday...

12:48.330 --> 12:50.160
I'll do a dance for her!

12:51.880 --> 12:54.120
<i>Is she going to do that till I stop her?</i>

12:54.120 --> 12:57.580
Two years old! Two years old! Two years old!

12:55.050 --> 12:55.960
Really?

13:02.030 --> 13:05.050
Somewhere, someone's saying 
"two" over and over again!

13:06.640 --> 13:10.560
I've just told her to come 
to this room at midnight.

13:11.130 --> 13:14.280
I haven't told her about 
the celebration, or that you're here.

13:14.870 --> 13:17.170
I hope it's a good surprise!

13:17.170 --> 13:17.940
Yeah.

13:17.940 --> 13:20.850
But it's a special day, right?

13:20.850 --> 13:23.030
Shouldn't I go home right now?

13:23.280 --> 13:25.050
Don't worry.

13:25.050 --> 13:26.530
I'm the one who invited you.

13:26.530 --> 13:27.730
Then I'll stay!

13:27.730 --> 13:30.200
I hope your surprise is a success!

13:30.200 --> 13:32.490
Don't be so loud!

13:37.850 --> 13:38.970
Excuse me.

13:38.970 --> 13:39.920
Th-That's her!

13:41.230 --> 13:42.630
It's so dark.

13:42.850 --> 13:45.170
Your Grace... and Cuff?

13:45.170 --> 13:46.340
A-Alice?

13:46.930 --> 13:50.550
It's been two years since you 
came to the mansion, right?

13:50.810 --> 13:51.730
So...

13:51.730 --> 13:53.420
What a wonderful cake!

13:53.420 --> 13:56.270
Did you make this?

13:56.740 --> 13:57.740
Yes!

13:57.740 --> 13:59.440
Thank you.

13:59.440 --> 14:03.570
So that's why you were locked 
in the kitchen this morning.

14:03.570 --> 14:05.530
I make no promises as to the taste.

14:06.550 --> 14:08.740
It's so special, I don't think I can eat it.

14:10.110 --> 14:13.070
Alice... thanks for everything 
you've done these past two years.

14:13.070 --> 14:15.200
I hope you'll stay with me.

14:15.970 --> 14:17.140
Your Grace...

14:20.880 --> 14:28.650
It would make me so happy if 
I could be here forever and ever...

14:32.790 --> 14:35.350
I got you a present.

14:35.350 --> 14:37.850
Viola and I chose you an outfit.

14:37.850 --> 14:40.310
Oh my. Thank you.

14:40.310 --> 14:41.610
Try it on right now.

14:41.610 --> 14:42.460
Right now?

14:42.460 --> 14:44.910
N-No, I'm standing here!

14:44.910 --> 14:45.770
You can't change!

14:45.770 --> 14:47.360
I don't mind.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.700
I do!

14:48.700 --> 14:50.550
Oh, that's a shame.

14:50.550 --> 14:52.900
Go on, Alice. Blow on it.

14:53.630 --> 14:54.530
Blow!

14:54.530 --> 14:57.380
Not me! The cake!

14:57.380 --> 14:59.790
Oh my. My mistake.

14:59.790 --> 15:02.000
She's not even trying to hide 
that it wasn't a mistake!

15:05.730 --> 15:07.610
Are you okay, Your Grace?

15:08.280 --> 15:10.640
I didn't realize this would happen.

15:11.620 --> 15:15.020
Both of you, don't move 
until your eyes adjust.

15:15.020 --> 15:16.930
You don't want to touch me.

15:16.930 --> 15:17.720
Got it.

15:17.720 --> 15:18.890
Understood.

15:20.780 --> 15:22.630
What's this sound?

15:23.050 --> 15:26.610
With this little light, 
it feels safe to change.

15:27.690 --> 15:28.840
I'm taking my clothes off now.

15:31.700 --> 15:34.500
I can't see, but I can hear.

15:34.500 --> 15:36.050
Cuff, the lights.

15:36.050 --> 15:36.660
Sure.

15:45.990 --> 15:47.130
It's so fluffy.

15:47.770 --> 15:50.610
<i>She's so cute! So cute! So cute!</i>

15:50.610 --> 15:52.640
You're so cute, Alice!

15:52.640 --> 15:54.340
Thank you.

16:17.000 --> 16:18.620
That surprised me...

16:19.110 --> 16:22.330
I didn't think I'd find a hole in 
the roof when I walked you home.

16:22.330 --> 16:24.990
The boards in the roof must've been rotten.

16:24.990 --> 16:27.090
I'm glad the rain stopped.

16:27.090 --> 16:29.650
And today's a special day, too!

16:29.650 --> 16:32.050
From now on, sleep in the mansion.

16:32.400 --> 16:35.730
I'll make sure not to interrupt your sleep.

16:35.730 --> 16:37.840
Why are you acting like 
we'd sleep in the same bed?

16:37.840 --> 16:39.840
By the way, you two seen Daleth?

16:39.840 --> 16:41.520
No, why?

16:41.520 --> 16:45.230
Y-You're one of Daleth's girls...
 the trendy girl!

16:46.740 --> 16:48.940
I'm Keto! I command plants!

16:49.290 --> 16:53.500
I've decided to forget the fact 
that you made all my plants wilt!

16:53.500 --> 16:55.940
We trendy girls don't sweat the small stuff.

16:55.940 --> 16:57.780
G-Great.

16:58.210 --> 17:00.470
What happened with your roof, by the way?

17:00.470 --> 17:03.250
I was about to go to bed when it fell in...

17:04.420 --> 17:06.330
I think I can fix that.

17:06.330 --> 17:08.210
Leave it to me!

17:08.210 --> 17:09.680
A tree?

17:09.680 --> 17:11.510
This should make good wood.

17:11.510 --> 17:13.940
Wait, what are you doing?

17:13.940 --> 17:17.050
I'm gonna DIY her up a new house!

17:17.050 --> 17:17.870
Oh my.

17:17.870 --> 17:18.850
Why would you do that?

17:18.850 --> 17:19.930
Especially at this hour!

17:19.930 --> 17:24.250
Stop asking questions! Get out of here!

17:25.520 --> 17:26.900
Trendy girls are scary!

17:26.900 --> 17:28.230
There, there.

17:28.230 --> 17:30.030
I'll fix it tonight.

17:30.030 --> 17:33.150
Go sleep somewhere else.

17:35.370 --> 17:37.320
Maybe she's a good person.

17:37.700 --> 17:39.940
Yeah, she is.

17:39.940 --> 17:40.780
But...

17:41.020 --> 17:43.580
Your Grace, may I take the left side?

17:43.580 --> 17:45.370
I'm not sleeping in the same bed as you!

17:45.370 --> 17:46.270
But...

17:46.270 --> 17:48.110
You take the bed.

17:48.110 --> 17:49.670
I'll sleep on the floor.

17:49.670 --> 17:51.290
And nowhere else!

17:51.290 --> 17:54.010
It's been a while since 
you've thrown a tantrum.

17:54.010 --> 17:55.690
It's rather cute.

17:59.530 --> 18:01.740
<i>The floor's hard.</i>

18:02.430 --> 18:03.850
<i>I can't sleep...</i>

18:09.930 --> 18:13.450
<i>That's the rose I gave her, right?</i>

18:14.870 --> 18:16.980
<i>She brought it with her?</i>

18:17.610 --> 18:19.740
<i>Like it's really important or something.</i>

18:27.930 --> 18:29.120
<i>I do love her.</i>

18:32.450 --> 18:35.110
I brought you something to drink, Keto!

18:35.110 --> 18:36.620
Want to take a break?

18:36.620 --> 18:38.760
I just got started.

18:48.140 --> 18:49.290
Are you okay?

18:49.290 --> 18:50.980
I broke a nail!

18:50.980 --> 18:52.160
I-Is that all?

18:52.160 --> 18:54.660
You got any long acrylic nails?

18:54.660 --> 18:56.440
Sorry, I don't know what that is!

18:56.730 --> 18:59.400
Aw, now I don't want to do anything.

19:02.710 --> 19:05.550
Well, Teto will make me 
feel better later, I guess.

19:05.550 --> 19:07.910
I wish I could copy that trendy girl mind.

19:11.300 --> 19:16.090
Daleth's doing all she can to hold 
the place together after Sade left.

19:16.790 --> 19:19.110
Even though she's hardly 
cut out to be a boss.

19:19.470 --> 19:22.430
I want her to live the life she chooses...

19:22.640 --> 19:26.630
But she's taken a bit too much of a 
liking to a human man, your brother,

19:26.630 --> 19:28.770
and I don't know how I feel about that.

19:30.560 --> 19:33.860
Do all witches hate humans?

19:34.530 --> 19:39.230
Well, a lot of our friends 
died in the old witch hunts.

19:39.230 --> 19:39.820
But...

19:40.230 --> 19:42.050
History does change.

19:42.050 --> 19:45.030
And maybe now's the time.

19:45.560 --> 19:50.320
We're willing to be friends with humans,
 if that's what Daleth wants.

19:57.000 --> 19:58.300
Well?

19:58.300 --> 20:00.080
I brought in all new furniture, too!

20:00.080 --> 20:02.250
Wow. Thank you.

20:02.250 --> 20:03.470
It's barely recognizable.

20:03.970 --> 20:06.640
You can have great parties 
with your girlfriends here.

20:06.640 --> 20:10.970
If you do, I want you to call Daleth, 
and me, and my girlfriend, Teto!

20:10.970 --> 20:11.940
Is that okay?

20:12.160 --> 20:13.570
Yes, of course!

20:13.570 --> 20:15.420
Hooray!

20:18.160 --> 20:19.570
I'll start over.

20:19.570 --> 20:20.990
Yeah, thanks.

20:22.900 --> 20:24.450
What a great meal!

20:24.450 --> 20:26.410
So, what do we eat next?

20:26.410 --> 20:28.890
Why don't you go on one of 
those eating competition shows?

20:30.600 --> 20:32.660
Hey, is that you, Hugo?

20:34.830 --> 20:36.880
Who are those guys?

20:36.880 --> 20:38.450
My old buddies.

20:38.450 --> 20:39.530
Let's go.

20:39.530 --> 20:41.090
So it's true, then?

20:41.090 --> 20:45.800
You joined a weird circus and 
now you hang out with weirdos!

20:46.230 --> 20:50.180
Oh no, Cuff! They called you a weirdo.

20:50.180 --> 20:51.390
They called you one too, Zain.

20:51.390 --> 20:53.890
You said all that stuff when 
you quit pickpocketing,

20:53.890 --> 20:56.870
but you just ended up in a weird 
circus where you play around all day!

20:56.870 --> 20:59.050
That's perfect for you, Hugo!

20:59.050 --> 20:59.570
What?

21:00.950 --> 21:01.900
Wait!

21:03.230 --> 21:04.530
Why did you stop me?

21:04.530 --> 21:07.110
They were insulting the circus!

21:07.110 --> 21:09.010
This is Hugo's fight.

21:09.010 --> 21:11.390
Let him finish it.

21:12.360 --> 21:14.580
Where did they go?

21:23.820 --> 21:26.720
Oh, I just scared them a little.

21:26.720 --> 21:29.220
They tried to steal my bag.

21:29.650 --> 21:31.680
Don't call the police, please.

21:32.260 --> 21:34.140
Damn it! Let's go!

21:34.140 --> 21:35.650
Move, Hugo! Or I'll kill you!

21:37.230 --> 21:41.570
Say what you want about me, but don't 
you dare insult the circus again!

21:43.120 --> 21:44.520
Forget you!

21:48.030 --> 21:50.490
<i>Who were those guys?</i>

21:52.420 --> 21:54.310
<i>It's hasn't been raining...</i>

21:55.010 --> 21:57.680
<i>I guess I should tell Zain and Cuff.</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
The Duke, Alice, and the Flying Broom

23:35.580 --> 23:39.200
"The Duke, Alice, and the Flying Broom."
